Z||000000||mrfixit58||09-06-2000||10:26 AM||||Just thought I'd pass along this little tid-bit...<P>My new Cooperative Education Exchange Student is from Germany. He followed me to the parking lot to get something from my car and when he saw my 87 Bubble Gum Blue GT he stopped in his tracks and said "Is that a Ferrari?"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Of course, I educated him on the Pontiac Fiero and have promised him a ride in the near future.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <P>Just hought I'd pass that along,<BR>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||6
